used under the GNU Lesser General Public License 3; FFmpeg is copyright
the FFmpeg developers and used under the GNU Lesser General Public
License 2.1 or later (only its HEVC decoder is built in). Both licences
are in Licence. LumenHEIF itself is copyright (C) 2026 Andrew Youll and
released under the MIT licence. Its source (in Lumen's source,
plugins.heif), the libheif and FFmpeg sources it was built from, and the
changes made to FFmpeg for RISC OS are published with each release, so
LumenHEIF can be rebuilt with changed versions of the libraries.
